### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

November 8, 2022
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-7-23 for One (1) New Reel Grinder and One (1) New
Bedknife Grinder for the City of Cheyenne Golf Division
 ______________________________________________
Bid #E-7-23 was solicited for One (1) New Reel Grinder and One (1) New Bedknife Grinder for
the City of Cheyenne Golf Division.
One (1) bidder responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bid was received
from:
1. LL Johnson Distributing Company.  Commerce City, CO.

The bids were reviewed by Ron Card (CRE - Golf), and Jason Sanchez (CRE), and their
recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from LL Johnson in an amount not to
exceed $94,370.10.

Funding:
041-17-1744-46-43102 / (Golf Facilities Fund / Equipment)
```

